```{=html}
<div class="featured-grid">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<div class="featured-card" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
  <div class="fc-venue"><%= item.short_venue %></div>
  <div class="fc-title"><% if (item.url) { %><a href="<%- item.url %>"><%= item.title %></a><% } else { %><%= item.title %><% } %></div>
  <p class="fc-summary"><%= item.summary %></p>
</div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
